{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00737","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享章怀太子庙乐章 武舞作 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享章怀太子庙乐章 武舞作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿林炽炎历，黄虞格有苗。\n沙尘惊塞外，帷幄命嫖姚。\n七德干戈止，三边云雾消。\n宝祚长无极，歌舞盛今朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}